        "text": "Buses cover most suburbs. Cash is not accepted; use an AT HOP card or contactless card. Fares start around NZ$2.80 per zone with free transfers within 30 minutes."
      },
      {
        "mode": "Ferry",
        "has": true,
        "text": "Ferries leave the CBD for Hauraki Gulf islands and Devonport. A quick, scenic way to cross the harbour."
      },
